  "title": "The Estée Lauder Companies to Participate in the Morgan Stanley Luxury Conference",
  "summary": "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- Stéphane de La Faverie, President and Chief Executive Officer, and Nadine Graf, President, EMEA, UK&I, and Emerging Markets, of The Estée Lauder Companies Inc. (NYSE: EL) will participate in the Morgan Stanley Luxury Conference 2026 in Paris on Tuesday, May 19, 2026, at 4:00 p.m. CEST.",
